WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.280
Levoit appeared in every answer.

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.500
But it came first just once.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:07.490
Recoscope’s November thirteenth
humidifier benchmark

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:12.570
captured twelve usable answers across
four AI assistants and three prompt types.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.950
Levoit appeared in all twelve.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.970
Carepod appeared in six.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.490
But in the four comparisons,
ChatGPT and Perplexity

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.000
ranked Carepod first.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.130
Gemini ranked Levoit first,

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:25.870
and Claude ranked Dreo first.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:27.890
So the brand with the most mentions

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.540
wasn’t the one with the most
first-place rankings.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:31.670
For brands,

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:34.490
visibility and first choice
are separate measures.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.510
These findings describe
captured AI answers,

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:38.830
not product quality.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.500
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
